issue_context.body:
We plan to abstract out Reflection.Emit APIs as preparation for adding [`AssemblyBuilder.Save()` equivalent in .NET Core](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/issues/62956). So that we can have two implementations, one that having old code to support all downlevel runtime, and a new implementation that replaces the current Reflection.Emit implementation.
UPDATE: [Link to Updated Proposal](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/issues/78542#issuecomment-1400821064)
