<details>
<summary>Issue Details</summary>
<hr />

We plan to abstract out Reflection.Emit APIs for adding [`AssemblyBuilder.Save()` in .NET Core](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/issues/15704). So that we can have two implementations, one that having old code to support all downlevel runtime, and a new implementation that replaces the current Reflection.Emit implementation with AssemblyBuilder.Save() support.

